  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* fix: handle kubectl connection error in ns selection by @pasteley in https://github.com/kubie-org/kubie/pull/400\r\n* fix: bump skim to v3.3 by @pasteley in https://github.com/kubie-org/kubie/pull/399\r\n* fix: handle EDITOR env variable correctly by @aellwein in https://github.com/kubie-org/kubie/pull/393\r\n* Bump the all group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubie-org/kubie/pull/402\r\n* Bump the all group with 4 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubie-org/kubie/pull/407\r\n* Bump the all group across 1 directory with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kubie-org/kubie/pull/413\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @aellwein made their first contribution in https://github.com/kubie-org/kubie/pull/393\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kubie-org/kubie/compare/v0.27.0...v0.28.0",
